{
  "_resourceType": "script",
  "id": "b2e37397-1f1f-47fa-95d5-b2cba8bf8460",
  "name": "PlayerTakeDamage",
  "description": "Reusable player damage script with knockback.\n\nUse this when an enemy physically hits the player and should push him away from the attacker.\n\nPlayerIframeTime - rate-limit/invulnerability timer variable.\nDamageTaken - HP amount to subtract.\nActor 1 Attacker - enemy/hurtbox used as the knockback source.\n\nFlow: rate limit -> subtract HP -> bump player away from attacker -> show hurt emote -> call CheckPlayerHPAfterDamage. That checker updates the HUD, plays Low_Health at 3/2/1 HP, and sends the player to GAME OVER at 0 HP.",
